3. Account and access risk

Crawler-style access, browser automation, automated login, abnormal cookie reuse, high-frequency requests or attempts to bypass platform controls may trigger rate limits, CAPTCHA or verification challenges, IP blocking, account restrictions, account suspension or account bans. This risk includes, but is not limited to, Xiaohongshu/RedNote (XHS), Douyin, Bilibili, Kuaishou, Weibo, Zhihu and YouTube. Use dedicated test accounts where possible.

